------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  ! Clone a repository into /srv/new-example?                                                                           
                                                                                                                        
  Next the SSH address is asked and the host key shown. Nothing changes before the last question.                       
                                                                                                                        
    folder: /srv/new-example                                                                                            
    case: clone (the folder is missing or empty and gets a clone of a repository)                                       
    the folder is missing; the nearest existing folder is /srv                                                          
    owner: root, group: root, mode: 0755                                                                                
    the service can write it: no                                                                                        
    permissions are set: no                                                                                             
                                                                                                                        
  Changes after yes                                                                                                     
    The folder is created with owner qdeploy:qdeploy and mode 0755.                                                     
    The host key is stored and the repository is cloned into the folder.                                                
    No permission changes: the service can write already.                                                               
    The folder is added to the systemd drop-in of the service, which restarts once.                                     
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
y continue  n/esc/enter cancel                                                                            up/down scroll
